Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经功成名就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the fast track once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是每月最佳员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Employee of the month every month -- forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们让我解决你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they assigned me you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我竟然不能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't close the deal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个穿着法兰绒的可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a couple of pathetic, flannel-wearing maggots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's laughing at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是约翰·温彻斯特的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're John Winchester's sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当不该受这诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam doesn't have to be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是温彻斯特家的人  他已经被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Winchester. He's already cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是亚当  一直就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Adam. You've never been Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀不死路西法  你在逐渐失去对自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill the devil, and you're losing faith
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你弟弟的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}in yourself, your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝是你最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}God was your last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要去做蠢事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna do something stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如米迦勒版迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Michael stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你打算干什么  别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're thinking of doing, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被炒鱿鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pink-slipped?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么明显哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That obvious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同病相怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外包惹的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Outsourcing."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你犯了何种反人类罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your crime against humanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千年项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal of the millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最最简单的一个同意都要不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't even get the one simple "Yes" I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最低盈利要求总得达到  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to nail that bottom line, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.85,0:01:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面那些人唯一关心的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All they care about upstairs, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果  结果  结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Results, results, results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们从不下到底层  到这滩烂泥里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not down on the ground, in the mud,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们这些猪一样肮脏的人类打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}nose to nose with all you pig-filthy humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说得不对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太对了  肮脏的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely -- filthy what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  他们的义气都哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, whatever happened to personal loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为他们工作多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I worked for these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五千年  六千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five millennia? Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉确实那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like it, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒迦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯图尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下一步想怎么办  斯图尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonn do next, Stuart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.49,0:02:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许做些与网略有关的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something to do with the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我个了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:44.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  任何事情  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Anything. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让我回去  我不会让你失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just -- just put me back in. You won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子们  爷又上岗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in business, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第5季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(罗伯特·辛格  收)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给别人寄糖呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending someone a candygram?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去自杀  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告别之旅的行程很容易猜得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too hard to figure out the stops on the farewell tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Lisa doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想去自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说米迦勒不会拿你当牵线木偶来使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Michael's not about to make you his muppet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎样  就这样结束了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man? This is how it ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就  甩手不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just... Walk out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都在逃避的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you've ever done is run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我错了  每一次的逃避都是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was wrong every single time I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...  Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比在研究对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby is working on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  什么对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有对策  你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got nothing, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我一定要阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I have to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  你放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次可没有恶魔血助你一臂之力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not all hopped up on demon blood this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我带了帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I brought help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  真好  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, this is good, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八个月来各种瞎忙活  一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight months of turned pages and screwed pooches,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是今天  一夜之间就会发生奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight... tonight's when the magic happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么还不让我滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, why don't you let me get out of your hair, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你犯什么病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯了认清现实的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用原子弹是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear's the only option we have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒能干掉路西法  救下很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael can ice the devil, save a boatload of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须找其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to think of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说着倒是容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that's easy for you to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法把地球毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if Lucifer burns this mother down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我本可以改变这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could have done something about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜怎么着  都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess what -- that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就此放弃  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't give up, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更无法理解我的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you ain't in my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我想用来射穿自己脑袋的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the round I mean to put through my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天早上  我都会看着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every morning, I look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许今天就该是我瞑目之日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maybe today's the day I flip the lights out."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我答应过你们  我不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I promised you I wouldn't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦让让  我要拿瓶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a beer. Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们的弟弟  亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Your brother? Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只确定一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one thing for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们得把他藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to hide him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我在哪  - 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where am I? - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:40.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松点  你安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会觉得有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna find this a little --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是非常疯狂  但事实上咱们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot crazy, but we're actually your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·温彻斯特也是我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester was our father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那这位就是迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I'm sure that's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:11:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么会  - 他们让我警惕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - They warned me about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁说的  - 天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who did? - The angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒迦利亚在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where the hell is Zachariah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  和我们说说这整件事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you just tell us everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从最开始说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时死了  然后去了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was dead and in heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过  那儿看起来像是我的舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Except it -- it, uh, kind of looked like my prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.61,0:12:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和一个女孩子打得火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was making out with this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫作克莉丝汀·米基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her -- her name was Kristin McGee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确  这听起来就像天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that sounds like heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上了三垒没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get to third base?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接  接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh...Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些天使  就凭空出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, these -- these angels, they popped out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后告诉我  我是被选中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they tell me that I-I'm chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么救\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和什么大天使会杀死路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, me and some archangel are gonna kill the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}What archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:13:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他的利剑或皮囊  或者什么其他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his, uh, sword or vessel or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, that's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此话怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们放弃你了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're moving on from you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他具有约翰·温彻斯特的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's John Winchester's bloodline,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是萨姆的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许不尽完美  但也不无可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not perfect, but it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.99,0:13:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们绝望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们高估了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they've wrongly assumed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为他勇敢到能经受住他们的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean would be brave enough to withstand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  卡西  来虐我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? Blow me, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了这么多事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything that's happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那关于命运的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that crap about destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然间天使就有了B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly the angels have a plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:38.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁会觉得这正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that smell right to anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  家人重聚真令人感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this has been a really moving family reunion,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我还有事  就\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, I got a thing, so --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不 不 不  坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. No, no, no. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真听着  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Adam...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the angels are lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们满嘴跑火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们是天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, 'cause they're angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉你他们要烧毁半个星球了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell you they were gonna roast half the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说了这会是惊险的一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said the fight might get pretty hairy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但对方是路西法  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is the devil, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们必须制止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确  但是还有其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but there's another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目标是  用爱拯救地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're working on the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-进展如何  - 不太顺哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that going? - Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, Adam...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俗话说知人知面不知心  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me from a hole in the wall, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  信任我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是血亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没资格跟我说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no right to say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你依然是约翰的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still John's boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.11,0:14:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  约翰·温切斯特是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, John Winchester was some guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每年带我看一场棒球赛的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took me to a baseball game once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:14:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能是血亲  但我们不是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we may be blood, but we are not family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈才是我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom is my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好好尽我本分  就能再次见到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I do my job, I get to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯  但让我上心的人是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no offense, but she's the one I give a rat's ass about,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但要是老爸给过你快乐的回忆  \N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you have one good memory of dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一次都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就给我们多一点点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll give us a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去弄点啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out for a...Beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我们有啤酒  坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We got beer. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你唱这么一出天真无邪的哥俩好的戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you pitch this whole dewy-eyed bromance thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上是想盯紧我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth is, I'm on lockdown, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you may not believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但老爸那样做是想保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but dad was trying to protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不把你卷进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping you from all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我想把我吞下去的那只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I guess the monster that ate me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没接到这消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't get that memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是那句  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比一年见一次老爸还糟糕的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing worse than seeing dad once a year
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是天天见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}was seeing him all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是满嘴跑大车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how full of crap you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么  - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个家只有我和我妈  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, it was me, and it was my mom, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在医院上夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}She worked the graveyard shift at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己做饭  自己睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cooked my own dinners. I put myself to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于我们的爸爸  你想怎么评论都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you can say whatever you want about our dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事实是  和爸爸相处是我梦寐以求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth is, I would have taken anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们知道我们还有个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we had known we had a brother --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you didn't, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...we would have found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法改变过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从今以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from here on out --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家钻进车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna hop in the family truckster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后一起到沃尔玛去血拼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop on down to Wally world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}attitude like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太适合这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd fit right in around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  不是我说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cass, not for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过上一个用这种小眼神儿看我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the last person who looked at me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们嘿咻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你去看着亚当吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, why don't you, uh, go keep an eye on Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很忙  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I mean, we got our hands full, Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满屋子人都时刻准备着\N{\fnArial\fs30}a houseful of flight risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让他那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁  亚当吗  我也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Adam? No, I'm -- I'm not, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不明白我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not getting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不  我完全了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, I "Get" You perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我也不会让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not letting you do it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让那孩子替我受罪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid's not taking a bullet for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 迪恩  - 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean  - I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看  有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, think about how many people 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被我们害死的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've gotten killed, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈  爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰丝  乔  埃伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess, Jo, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要继续数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是我们亲手杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也可能丢了小命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might as well have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我累了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再和本性抗争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of fighting who I'm supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你能不能消停个半秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you think maybe you could take a half a second
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再试着为改变现状而自我牺牲如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stop trying to sacrifice yourself for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定我们能一直在一起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could actually stick together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我吧  我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. I-I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.51,0:19:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不信什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们是会用恶魔血引诱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether it's gonna be demon blood
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是让另一个恶魔小妞勾引你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or some other demon chick or what, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道他们会设法让你魔化\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I do know they're gonna find a way to turn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我不够坚强吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying I'm not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你易怒  自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry, you're self-righteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法会占有你的身体的  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's gonna wear you to the prom, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是时间问题罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全天下人里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到撒旦控制了你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when Satan takes you over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有人出来和它战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's got to be somebody there to fight him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那个孩子可做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't gonna be that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  只有我来挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's got to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.94,0:22:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被传送到天边了[出自《绿野仙踪》]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blown to O.Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去把迪恩找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll get Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该还没走太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't have gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你在这看着亚当  - 怎么看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just watch Adam.  - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.14,0:22:40.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又不是不知道  他稍占点身高优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have noticed, he's got a slight height advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就把他绑在你轮椅上  随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then cuff him to your chair. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看住他就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈不会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's not coming, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个公园吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the park
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.33,0:23:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈休息时常带你来玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}where your mom took you on her day off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.49,0:23:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在还不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not coming -- not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她很快就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she will...soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.31,0:23:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是撒迦利亚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Zachariah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.54,0:23:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在的所在地可不对  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't where you were supposed to be, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也无法找到你的确切位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't quite zero in on you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就大胆猜猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let me take a wild guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟萨姆和迪恩在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with Sam and Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前不也说过他们的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we tell you about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道他们不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know you can't trust them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道那对兄弟的关系不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Sam and Dean Winchester are psychologically,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁少了谁都要死要活\N{\fnArial\fs30}irrationally, erotically codependent
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就差没乱伦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也搞不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟我讲了点你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said a few things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.54,0:24:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.15,0:24:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  孩子  等到大难临头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, kid, when the heat gets hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们才不会为你考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not gonna give a flying crap about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们宁可给彼此弄点甜培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they'd rather save each other's sweet bacon
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不会去拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}than save the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.61,0:24:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.03,0:24:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.25,0:24:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想再见到你妈妈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to see your mom again or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,末日就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启已经降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Apocalypse is upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.72,0:24:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们跟我交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.04,0:24:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要我向你们传达这消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they asked me to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.40,0:24:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-天启  - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Apocalypse --  - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.37,0:24:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪恩·温彻斯特  认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean Winchester. Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:24:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你是认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你那帮天使朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I need you to pray to your angel buddies
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.89,0:25:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let them know that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.83,0:25:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吾父在上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father, who art in heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.25,0:25:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿汝名被尊为圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}hallowed be thy name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你祷告太大声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pray too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么  疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了你而堕天  你就这么回报我吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rebelled for this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.12,0:25:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今  你才想到要向他们妥协?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that you could surrender to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.02,0:25:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.23,0:25:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为你付出了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.63,0:25:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到头来  我换来什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is what you give to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.45,0:25:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.84,0:26:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  亚当不见了是啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what do you mean, "Adam is gone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我说的是鸟语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I say it in Spanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会消失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone how?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.27,0:26:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在搞什么  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.44,0:26:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子  和我说话小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your tone, boy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.05,0:26:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他前一刻还在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后一秒就凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he disappeared into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为天使带走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the angels took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.15,0:26:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这又是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.01,0:26:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.99,0:26:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说天使带走了亚当是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, the angels took Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.19,0:26:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在他的肋骨上刻了咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You branded his ribs, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.46,0:26:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  肯定是亚当提示了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Adam must have tipped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.70,0:26:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么提示  - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是在梦里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们会把他带去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where would they have taken him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你和你哥哥口味相同啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you and your brother share the same refined palate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.49,0:27:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思  为了米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, for what? For Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.97,0:27:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.47,0:27:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这绝不轻松  但是我恐怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is never easy, but I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.04,0:27:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的职责到此就不得不告一段落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've had to terminate your position at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.25,0:27:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你辛苦出了很多力  真的  干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been a hell of a sport, really -- good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.75,0:27:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你更像是个湿漉漉的小诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not so much the "Chosen one" as you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.25,0:27:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而并非那个被选定的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a clammy scrap of bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.36,0:27:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你以前的话又是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but what about the stuff that you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.32,0:27:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该和恶魔战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm suposed to fight th devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.86,0:27:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就你吗  省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算是个安慰吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if it's any consolation,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个我们想要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happen to be the illegitimate half brother
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:27:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正好是他的半个私生兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the guy we do care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.00,0:27:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还算不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  是你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you lied...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所说的一切都是在骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.00,0:28:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.34,0:28:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是隐瞒了部分真相  以便操控你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just avoided certain truths to manipulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.27,0:28:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.51,0:28:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我好受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how do you think I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是得忍受你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one that's got to put up
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.73,0:28:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一脸的呆滞木讷相啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that dumb, slack-jawed look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  我们没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, we didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.15,0:28:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特家有个致命弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The winchesters got one blind spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩得摒弃前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Sam and Dean, they're gonna put aside their differences,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're gonna come get you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.23,0:28:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就会把迪恩引到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is gonna put Dean right...Here --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.57,0:28:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来  便正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where I need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.60,0:28:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  今夜是关键的一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the night, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.84,0:28:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是属于我们的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.92,0:28:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒早就预见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切终于步上正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tumblers finally click into place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.74,0:28:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都归功于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.84,0:28:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我  但是谁会管这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me. But who's keeping score?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.91,0:28:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得美  我不会让你得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not gonna let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  软木头  坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool your jets, corky. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.08,0:28:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起做这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是可以拿到离职金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, you still get your severance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.19,0:28:56.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仍可以见到你妈妈  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still get to see your mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.39,0:28:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我凭什么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.99,0:29:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前一直太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep hearing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.03,0:29:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来老子得来点硬的才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I want to be hearing is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.37,0:29:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,友情提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word to the wise...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.38,0:29:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惹怒天然呆天使的下场可不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't piss off the nerd angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.89,0:29:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.79,0:29:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使带走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agels have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.70,0:29:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他们之前带你去的那间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The room where they took you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.92,0:29:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.67,0:29:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西去查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass did a recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里满是天堂的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the place is crawling with mooks --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.57,0:29:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满脸假仁假义  口蜜腹剑的天使混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty much a no-shot-in-hell, hail-mary kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.84,0:29:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, so the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.91,0:30:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.08,0:30:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们数量太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.35,0:30:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单打独斗可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do it alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.75,0:30:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说这镇上也只有你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, you're pretty much the only game in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.33,0:30:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定不会后悔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.97,0:30:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西和鲍比不认同我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass and Bobby think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.47,0:30:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.30,0:30:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听他们的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.78,0:30:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要不是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because either it's a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.14,0:30:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我引过去  好逼我就范\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get me there, to make me say yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.91,0:30:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不是圈套  不管怎样  我都会答应他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's not a trap I'm gonna say yes anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.26,0:30:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定会  事先警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will. I'll do it -- fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了关键时刻  你就会做出正确决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}When push shoves, you'll make the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.73,0:30:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是换作是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if tables were turned...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你烂在这地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd let you rot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也没错  我做得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I have let you rot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.91,0:30:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能我比较笨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm not that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.48,0:31:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂  萨姆  你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't get it. Sam, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.61,0:31:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.05,0:31:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你依然是我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}...You're still my Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.35,0:31:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.55,0:31:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加州范奈司市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Van Nuys, California.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个靓屋在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the beautiful room
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.91,0:31:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那间靓屋居然在加州范奈斯市的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beautiful room is in an abandoned muffler factory
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.66,0:31:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一座废弃的消音器工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Van Nuys, California?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你觉得是在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you think it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.42,0:31:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  木星?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know. Jupiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.92,0:31:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丁点儿家伙上?  反正不是范奈司市\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blade of grass? Not van nuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不懂  为什么你不能带着亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me again why you don't just grab Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.01,0:31:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接瞬间转移离开那鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shazam the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那里至少有5个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there are at least five angels in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.01,0:31:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-又怎样  你很快啊  - 他们更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? You're fast. - They're faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.11,0:31:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会搞定他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll clear them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.06,0:31:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩去救那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two grab the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.79,0:31:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.02,0:32:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  你要对付5个天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, wait. You're gonna take on five angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.21,0:32:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是找死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.36,0:32:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.84,0:32:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比看着你妥协来得强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I won't have to watch you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.03,0:32:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.17,0:32:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不像萨姆那样有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the same faith in you that Sam does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.90,0:32:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿那个干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.43,0:33:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.42,0:33:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.09,0:34:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:34:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为了我而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.78,0:34:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.42,0:35:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.49,0:35:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  迪恩  你也太天真了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, please. Did you really think it would be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.43,0:35:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.84,0:35:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我吃那么多堑长了什么智吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've learned from this experience, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耐心可贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.77,0:35:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.38,0:35:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了他  你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.81,0:35:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以为自己肯定被抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought I was downsized for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.43,0:35:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你们的话说  叫解雇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for us, a firing -- pretty damn literal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.18,0:35:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我早该相信我的头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I should have trusted the boss man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.85,0:35:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都在他的意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all playing out like he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.21,0:35:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  我  还有你那吐血的兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, me, your hemorrhaging brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.62,0:35:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于准备好了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're finally ready, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.82,0:35:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有其他选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never been a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.63,0:35:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放过他们  快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什么来交换呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.06,0:36:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  撒迦利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Zachariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.69,0:36:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别伤害他们  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.37,0:36:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.37,0:36:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.84,0:36:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.33,0:36:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.40,0:36:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.69,0:36:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把米迦勒叫来  你这混蛋  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Michael down, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.96,0:36:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道你有没有骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're not lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.59,0:36:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来像骗人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I'm lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.86,0:37:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他即将莅临\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.19,0:37:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我还有些条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I have a few conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.16,0:37:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.05,0:37:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我答应之前  你要保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few people whose safety you have to guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.93,0:37:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.02,0:37:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  哪些人  你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, fine. Make a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.43,0:37:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非米迦勒灭了你  不然他休想占有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Michael can't have me until he disintegrates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.15,0:37:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.94,0:37:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.49,0:37:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒要想得到我这身臭皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Michael gets one piece of this sweet ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得先把你化为灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has to turn you into a piece of charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.46,0:37:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为米迦勒会那样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think Michael's gonna go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.16,0:37:50.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在孰轻孰重  他还不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's more important to him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.64,0:37:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.25,0:37:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.13,0:38:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只不过是个小角色  不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing but a maggot inside a worm's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.13,0:38:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我把你交给米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.84,0:38:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对他而言意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I deliver you to Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.38,0:38:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是炮灰一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.61,0:38:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒不可能杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael's not gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.35,0:38:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.98,0:38:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你自己能走吗  - 能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you walk? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.87,0:38:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.93,0:38:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.13,0:38:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.56,0:38:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.04,0:38:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁来救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could anyone help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.87,0:38:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.72,0:39:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住  我会救你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.01,0:39:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当  听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.14,0:39:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Adam's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.35,0:39:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.31,0:39:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道卡西怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.91,0:39:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们会找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.59,0:39:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.33,0:39:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"So" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.12,0:39:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.08,0:40:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚在那儿  你是真想答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were totally rockin' the yes back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.07,0:40:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.20,0:40:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想听真话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.81,0:40:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是这一堆破事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damndest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.42,0:40:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the world's ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.57,0:40:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被压得不堪重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls are coming down on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.25,0:40:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回想起来  我脑海里唯一的想法就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I look over to you and all I can think about is
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是某个蠢材把我拖下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This stupid son of a bitch brought me here."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.91,0:40:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不想让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want to let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.91,0:40:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.39,0:40:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.77,0:40:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你悬崖勒马\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.21,0:40:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.63,0:40:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  老哥  不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.88,0:40:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...let me say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.37,0:40:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道弟控是不是都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it's being a big brother or what,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.51,0:40:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但对我而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.95,0:40:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是个流鼻涕的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been this snot-nosed kid
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.71,0:41:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要我管东管西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've had to keep on the straight and narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.88,0:41:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在我们都知道你已经长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both know that that's not you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.32,0:41:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  你是长大了  懂得信任我  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, if you're grown-up enough to find faith in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.93,0:41:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我应该投桃报李吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the least I can do is return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.81,0:41:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  去他妈的命运使然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, screw destiny right in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们用我们的方式  和他们斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we take the fight to them, do it our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.77,0:41:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.
